{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fireworks Incremental</strong> is an incremental game about fireworks. You start small with a single mortar firing small fireworks. Each explosion generates Booms - your main currency, which you can spend on new, specialized units, new buildings and powerful upgrades to make even bigger, better and more colourful fireworks!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Active incremental gameplay about fireworks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock buildings like the Arsenal, Observatory or Wizard Tower, each with unique mechanics and upgrades</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hire Artillerists, Scholars and Wizards to boost your fireworks production</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chase milestone spectacles - choreographed fireworks shows that reward your progress</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A complete experience with a real ending - no idling forever</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beautiful, retro pixel art fireworks - and you can even turn off the CRT effect!</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3950670?t=1773949811","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3950670?t=1773949811","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3950670/05ad9c004234c06705d6d819d88558294d76161b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773949811","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3950670/05ad9c004234c06705d6d819d88558294d76161b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773949811","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fireworks Incremental</strong> is an incremental game about fireworks. You start small with a single mortar firing small fireworks. Each explosion generates Booms - your main currency, which you can spend on new, specialized units, new buildings and powerful upgrades to make even bigger, better and more colourful fireworks!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Active incremental gameplay about fireworks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock buildings like the Arsenal, Observatory or Wizard Tower, each with unique mechanics and upgrades</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hire Artillerists, Scholars and Wizards to boost your fireworks production</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chase milestone spectacles - choreographed fireworks shows that reward your progress</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A complete experience with a real ending - no idling forever</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beautiful, retro pixel art fireworks - and you can even turn off the CRT effect!</p></li></ul>","developers":["Frajda Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3950670/fac5df427331a03fa2e260a6c0dddb2368fcbd23/header.jpg?t=1773949811","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3950670/1929072501/25b2319c1f9d267d521c065c6c5d24148434a895/1773949301/dash_av1.mpd?t=1773949809","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3950670/1929072501/25b2319c1f9d267d521c065c6c5d24148434a895/1773949301/dash_h264.mpd?t=1773949809","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3950670/1929072501/25b2319c1f9d267d521c065c6c5d24148434a895/1773949301/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1773949809","id":257182313,"name":"Teaser","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257182313/27a